    <description><![CDATA[## Install

```powershell
choco install cdxgen
```

Chocolatey downloads the official Windows build from the [cdxgen/cdxgen](https://github.com/cdxgen/cdxgen/releases) releases and puts it on your PATH.

## What is cdxgen?

Creates CycloneDX Bill of Materials (BOM) for your projects from source and container images. Supports many languages and package managers. Integrate in your CI/CD pipeline with automatic submission to Dependency Track server.

Upstream describes it with these topics: bom, cbom, containers, cyclonedx, docker, oci, owasp, package-url.

## Upgrade

```powershell
choco upgrade cdxgen
```

## Uninstall

```powershell
choco uninstall cdxgen
```

